5 Work in pairs. Read out the emails.
Unit 1 Period 1
Hi Basim,
Thanks for replying. I like the dramatic picture! My brother is football crazy, too.
He’s next to me in the picture that I’m attaching.
About my first picture: yes, that’s me nearest the camera. We’re on a school trip in
the Lake District. We go up there from Manchester every year.
Dad is leaving very soon. But when? He had a date, but it was cancelled. Have you
got any news?
Jenny
SEND
From:
To:
Subject:
jenny@myworld.com
RE: Hello
basim@myworld.com
Dear Jenny,
No, but it’s soon. There’s a special apartment for him near our house in Jericho.
We’ll help him settle in – take him out and show him round.
It’s late. Must stop.
Bye for now,
Basim
SEND
From:
To:
Subject:
basim@myworld.com
RE: Hello
jenny@myworld.com
Dear Basim,
Now it’s definite. Dad’s flying next Saturday – 1st October. His flight departs at
08:30 our time and arrives at 15:15 Palestine local time. We’re going to miss him
a lot, but he promises he’ll call every day. I’m pleased he’s going to live near you.
I’m sure that’ll make life easier.
Best,
Jenny
SEND
From:
To:
Subject:
jenny@myworld.com
RE: Hello
basim@myworld.com
